# org-target: docs/10-19-design/10-architecture/10.21-engineering-design-audit-and-delivery-plan.org::#engineering-audit-conclusion
# render-layout: elk; theme: 0; pad: 24; timeout: 30
direction: down
classes: {
  inspected: {style.fill: "#E6F5F3"; style.stroke: "#19756C"; style.border-radius: 10}
  plan: {style.fill: "#EAF2FF"; style.stroke: "#315B8A"; style.border-radius: 10}
  boundary: {style.fill: "#FFF2DD"; style.stroke: "#9B6C25"; style.border-radius: 10}
}
baseline: "INSPECTED / bounded current evidence\n22 recorded results / 1,282 referenced files consistent\nNo fresh native execution, build or performance run\nCurrent implementation differs from HEAD and staged index" {class: inspected}
findings: "OPEN / source-backed findings\nUnsupported model scope aliases a supported basis\nNative Scenario source argument is not bound to supplied scopes\nConsumed exports exceed publication Contract checks\nCanonical hierarchy / project Aitia / evaluation remain open" {class: boundary}
g0: "G0 / DESIGN FREEZE FIRST\nSupported Profile/method domains and independent oracle expectations\nOne authoritative captured input / adequate POO Contracts\nCanonical parent, specialization and retained obligations\nConcrete acceptance controls before new case expansion" {class: plan}
g1: "G1 / ONE COHERENT OWNER SLICE\nDirect backpressure Library migration; no aliases or new loader\nClose scope/input/Contract findings with source and tests\nCore selected/unselected canary + package build\nFresh bounded Rust/QNT/Lean -> real ASCENT registration and reuse" {class: plan}
g2: "G2 / FIRST PROJECT AITIA CONSUMPTION\nNative Scheme / one explicit local review criterion and policy\nActual artifact, independent content review and exact request receipts\nMissing/stale/counter/expected-negative distinctions\nSynthetic applicability stays synthetic; no compliance claim" {class: plan}
g3: "G3 / SECOND MECHANISM\nBounded broadcast close/wake under canonical domain owner\nPreserve parent obligations; actual Tokio source mapping\nIndependent Rust + minimal QNT + ASCENT change evidence\nNo whole-runtime progress or performance inference" {class: plan}
g4: "G4 / BOUNDED EVALUATION\nExplicit executed subset of existing 24 variant contracts\nIndependent oracle, positive/negative controls and retained failures\nMatched resource / Agent / Review cost measurements where relevant\nPublish coverage denominator and claim-specific limits" {class: plan}
limit: "AUDIT BOUNDARY\nPriority order is reviewable; findings are not marked closed\nPreserve old receipts, dirty work and ignored raw logs\nNo implementation, runtime rerun or new framework this turn\nStop recursive case growth until first owner gates are qualified" {class: boundary}
baseline -> findings -> g0 -> g1 -> g2 -> g3 -> g4 -> limit
